-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      Played by the owner in JNext 2026-11-06 (Speed, Enhanced at both
              paces): approved. Automated JNext checks and the real loader on
              disposable card copies.

  Replay      Native lockstep in JNext against the original, not RZX. Enhanced
              at each pace: 4 driving scenes x 3 input trials; Orig. pace also
              6 autopilot tunnel routes; Speed: 4 driving scenes x 1 trial:
              the 57 player-state bytes identical at every update, every AY
              and beeper write identical by update, port and value. Briefing
              and attract demo, every mode: registers including R, 384 game
              bytes and sound identical at every loop end.

  Emulator    JNext 1.1.104 headless; real-loader results are recorded in the
              run report.

  Coverage    Stages 1-5 from fixtures, tunnel routes, briefing, attract demo,
              time-out game over and return to menu. Not covered: a full
              unassisted playthrough, the final ending, joystick options.

  Hardware    none

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
